  "raw": {
    "https://jobs.ufl.edu/": {
      "title": "Come for a job.Grow a career.Gain a community.",
      "description": "Careers - Come for a job. Grow a career. Gain a community. Skip to content Main Navigation Careers Benefits Benefits Plans Time-Away Perks & Support Community The University of Florida Working at UF Career Growth ﻿﻿Professional Development Career Paths Career Types Resources How to Apply Frequently Asked Questions Veterans’ Preference Explore Jobs How can we help you? Come for a job. Grow a career. Gain a community. Join a vibrant community that’s healing coastlines, exploring space, curing diseases and imagining wonders. Search for: Faculty Positions Join a community of distinguished scholars and educators at the University of Florida, where your expertise will drive innovation, teaching and research excellence. Staff Positions Join our community of career professionals in a variety of roles across a range of fields such as accounting, IT, health care, and more. Other Opportunities Join us as a Graduate Assistant, Student Assistant, or Postdoctoral Associate. Exclusive perks and benefits that grow with you. A whole-person approach to your well-being. Benefits Plans View the University of Florida's robust benefits plans including comprehensive health care, vision, dental, retirement planning, and a variety of optional programs to support you at work and beyond. Time Away Explore UF's collection of generous leave policies including sick and vacation time, paid family leave, paid medical leave and other extended leave programs. Perks & Support Learn more about the wide variety of perks and support services including employee discounts, mental health services, legal programs, employee education initiatives and more. Grow together. Grow greater. People come to UF for the diversity of job opportunities. They stay because they can grow their careers and gain a community. As a University of Florida employee, you’ll gain access to the institution’s extensive resources, cutting-edge technologies and opportunities for professional development to advance your career and beyond. Grow With Us A culture of care, opportunity and excellence for all. Join us at a top-tier intellectual playground limited only by your imagination, dreams and ambition. Become a part of a dynamic environment full of community partnerships, research opportunities and outreach programs that aim to improve the lives of people across the state of Florida and beyond. UF Community Resources How to Apply Frequently Asked Questions Veterans’ Preference Popular Topics How to Apply Frequently Asked Questions Veterans’ Preference Benefits Plans Career Paths Perks & Support Career Types Time-Away Working at UF The University of Florida ﻿﻿Professional Development Career Growth About UF About the University of Florida Our Research & Impact Learn about UF’s benefits Worklife Resources Connect Talent Acquisition & Onboarding 8am-5pm (352) 392-2477 talent@hr.ufl.edu 903 West University Avenue Gainesville, FL 32601 Facebook Instagram Twitter YouTube LinkedIn Privacy Statement Google Analytics Privacy Policy Translate Text-Only Site Map Web Update Requests Copyright © 2026, University of Florida"
    },
    "https://jobs.ufl.edu/benefits/plans/": {
      "title": "Benefits Plans",
      "description": "Benefits Plans - Careers Skip to content Main Navigation Careers Benefits Benefits Plans Time-Away Perks & Support Community The University of Florida Working at UF Career Growth ﻿﻿Professional Development Career Paths Career Types Resources How to Apply Frequently Asked Questions Veterans’ Preference Explore Jobs How can we help you? Homepage Benefits Benefits Plans Benefits Plans Benefits Benefits Plans Time-Away Perks & Support Community The University of Florida Working at UF Career Growth ﻿﻿Professional Development Career Paths Career Types Resources How to Apply Frequently Asked Questions Veterans’ Preference How to Qualify for Veterans’ Preference Resources for Veterans Explore Jobs Health Insurance Our comprehensive health insurance plans are designed to provide you with extensive coverage and peace of mind. Choose from a range of options tailored to meet your individual and family health needs, ensuring you receive the best care possible. Retirement Plans Secure your financial future with our competitive retirement plans . The University of Florida offers a variety of retirement options to help you plan for a comfortable and rewarding future, with expert guidance to maximize your savings and investments. Dental Insurance At the University of Florida we offer a range of comprehensive dental plans tailored to meet your needs including pre-tax dental insurance options and a flexible post-tax option that reimburses your dental expenses. Vision Insurance Keep your eye on the prize with our inclusive vision insurance plans . Access comprehensive coverage for eye exams, prescription eyewear, and other vision-related services, so you can always see clearly and take care of your eye health. Life Insurance Protect your loved ones with our reliable life insurance options . The University of Florida offers substantial life insurance plans to provide financial security and peace of mind for you and your family in any eventuality. Optional Insurance Plans Customize your coverage with our range of optional insurance plans . From cancer insurance to additional accident coverage, the University of Florida provides access to flexible options to ensure you have the protection you need for all aspects of your life. Take the next step toward your career goals. Explore a wide variety of unique opportunities at the University of Florida. Explore Jobs Page Contents Popular Topics How to Apply Frequently Asked Questions Veterans’ Preference Benefits Plans Career Paths Perks & Support Career Types Time-Away Working at UF The University of Florida ﻿﻿Professional Development Career Growth About UF About the University of Florida Our Research & Impact Learn about UF’s benefits Worklife Resources Connect Talent Acquisition & Onboarding 8am-5pm (352) 392-2477 talent@hr.ufl.edu 903 West University Avenue Gainesville, FL 32601 Facebook Instagram Twitter YouTube LinkedIn Privacy Statement Google Analytics Privacy Policy Translate Text-Only Site Map Web Update Requests Copyright © 2026, University of Florida"
    },
    "https://jobs.ufl.edu/benefits/time-away/": {
      "title": "Time-Away",
      "description": "Time-Away - Careers Skip to content Main Navigation Careers Benefits Benefits Plans Time-Away Perks & Support Community The University of Florida Working at UF Career Growth ﻿﻿Professional Development Career Paths Career Types Resources How to Apply Frequently Asked Questions Veterans’ Preference Explore Jobs How can we help you? Homepage Benefits Time-Away Time-Away Benefits Benefits Plans Time-Away Perks & Support Community The University of Florida Working at UF Career Growth ﻿﻿Professional Development Career Paths Career Types Resources How to Apply Frequently Asked Questions Veterans’ Preference How to Qualify for Veterans’ Preference Resources for Veterans Explore Jobs Leave Take time to recharge and care for yourself and loved ones with our generous leave plans . UF provides a variety of leave programs based on an employee’s salary plan, including vacation, sick leave, holidays, personal leave days and paid family leave. Paid Family Leave Our Paid Family Leave program offers 8 full weeks of leave over a 24-month period for qualifying events. It provides flexibility during major life events like personal medical issues, caring for the serious medical condition of an immediate family member, or the birth, placement, or fostering of a child. Paid Medical Leave Our Paid Medical Leave program offers up to 8 weeks of fully paid leave for eligible employees, ensuring you can prioritize your health or care for a loved one without additional financial stress. At the University of Florida, we are committed to supporting you during times of need. Sabbatical Our Sabbatical program offers eligible faculty the chance for professional renewal through travel, study, research and more. This opportunity can enrich your academic and professional journey at the University of Florida. Extended Leave Our Extended Leave program supports you with paid and unpaid leave options for medical, parental, military and personal reasons, ensuring you can take the time you need. Take the next step toward your career goals. Explore a wide variety of unique opportunities at the University of Florida. Explore Jobs Page Contents Popular Topics How to Apply Frequently Asked Questions Veterans’ Preference Benefits Plans Career Paths Perks & Support Career Types Time-Away Working at UF The University of Florida ﻿﻿Professional Development Career Growth About UF About the University of Florida Our Research & Impact Learn about UF’s benefits Worklife Resources Connect Talent Acquisition & Onboarding 8am-5pm (352) 392-2477 talent@hr.ufl.edu 903 West University Avenue Gainesville, FL 32601 Facebook Instagram Twitter YouTube LinkedIn Privacy Statement Google Analytics Privacy Policy Translate Text-Only Site Map Web Update Requests Copyright © 2026, University of Florida"
    },
    "https://jobs.ufl.edu/benefits/perks-support/": {
      "title": "Perks & Support",
      "description": "Perks & Support - Careers Skip to content Main Navigation Careers Benefits Benefits Plans Time-Away Perks & Support Community The University of Florida Working at UF Career Growth ﻿﻿Professional Development Career Paths Career Types Resources How to Apply Frequently Asked Questions Veterans’ Preference Explore Jobs How can we help you? Homepage Benefits Perks & Support Perks & Support Benefits Benefits Plans Time-Away Perks & Support Community The University of Florida Working at UF Career Growth ﻿﻿Professional Development Career Paths Career Types Resources How to Apply Frequently Asked Questions Veterans’ Preference How to Qualify for Veterans’ Preference Resources for Veterans Explore Jobs Employee Perks The UF GatorPerks discount program provides exclusive discounts to UF faculty and staff. UF employees have the opportunity to save at various businesses and retailers located across Florida. Enjoy discounts from travel to entertainment, health and wellness, and much more. Mental Health Services The Employee Assistance Program provides you with the support you need to navigate life’s challenges. All UF faculty, staff, graduate assistants, non-student OPS employees, housestaff/residents, and postdoc associates as well as their household members are eligible to receive services. Legal Services If you need additional legal services , UF offers a supplemental insurance plan called UFSelect that provides low-cost access to legal assistance, advice and representation on different types of legal services. Premiums are paid conveniently through payroll deduction. Employee Education Program Unlock your potential with the University of Florida’s Employee Education Program (EEP) , offering eligible full-time staff tuition assistance for up to six credit hours per semester. Enhance your skills and advance your career with courses at the nearest Florida institution. Wellness Resources From fitness classes to health education, financial literacy workshops, nutrition resources and more — UF offers a variety of wellness programs, toolkits and resources designed to support the well-being of faculty and staff. Child Care UF Early Childhood Collaboratory (EEC) is a center that enrolls children who have at least one parent or guardian associated with any college or department of The University of Florida or UF Health. Take the next step toward your career goals. Explore a wide variety of unique opportunities at the University of Florida. Explore Jobs Page Contents Popular Topics How to Apply Frequently Asked Questions Veterans’ Preference Benefits Plans Career Paths Perks & Support Career Types Time-Away Working at UF The University of Florida ﻿﻿Professional Development Career Growth About UF About the University of Florida Our Research & Impact Learn about UF’s benefits Worklife Resources Connect Talent Acquisition & Onboarding 8am-5pm (352) 392-2477 talent@hr.ufl.edu 903 West University Avenue Gainesville, FL 32601 Facebook Instagram Twitter YouTube LinkedIn Privacy Statement Google Analytics Privacy Policy Translate Text-Only Site Map Web Update Requests Copyright © 2026, University of Florida"
    },
    "https://jobs.ufl.edu/community/university-of-florida/": {
      "title": "The University of Florida",
      "description": "The University of Florida - Careers Skip to content Main Navigation Careers Benefits Benefits Plans Time-Away Perks & Support Community The University of Florida Working at UF Career Growth ﻿﻿Professional Development Career Paths Career Types Resources How to Apply Frequently Asked Questions Veterans’ Preference Explore Jobs How can we help you? Homepage Community The University of Florida The University of Florida Benefits Benefits Plans Time-Away Perks & Support Community The University of Florida Working at UF Career Growth ﻿﻿Professional Development Career Paths Career Types Resources How to Apply Frequently Asked Questions Veterans’ Preference How to Qualify for Veterans’ Preference Resources for Veterans Explore Jobs University Mission, Values and Culture Join a vibrant community at the University of Florida, where our mission, values and culture are the guiding force behind everything we do. With a commitment to excellence, discovery, freedom, community and stewardship, we create an environment where every individual thrives, innovation flourishes and the pursuit of knowledge knows no bounds. Experience an engaging professional environment where a career means more than just employment and become a valued member of a transformative institution shaping the future. Core Administrative Units Administrative units at the University of Florida play a crucial role in shaping our institution’s success. From Academic Affairs to Innovation & Partnerships, our diverse offices collaborate to uphold UF’s excellence and innovation, fostering an environment where every employee contributes to our collective impact. Overseen by the Office of the President and the Board of Trustees, UF is organized into the following administrative offices: Core Administrative Units Academic Affairs & Provost Advancement Agriculture & Natural Resources Business Affairs Chief Financial Officer Chief Information Officer Construction, Facilities & Auxiliary Operations Enrollment Management and Associate Provost General Counsel Government & Community Relations & University Secretary Health Affairs Human Resources Innovation & Partnerships Jacksonville Programs Marketing PK-12 and Pre-Bachelor’s Programs Research Sr. Advisor to the President Student Life University Athletic Association Departments, Schools & Centers Discover endless possibilities for growth and innovation in our diverse array of departments, schools and centers. Join us at the forefront of cutting-edge research and education. Departments, Schools, & Centers Accounting | Fisher School of Advertising African American Studies African Studies | Center for Agricultural and Biological Engineering Agricultural Education and Communication Agronomy Animal Sciences Anita Zucker Center for Excellence in Early Childhood Studies Anthropology Applied Physiology and Kinesiology Architecture | School of Art + Art History | School of Arts in Medicine | Center for Astronomy Biomedical Engineering Biology Bob Graham Center Business | Heavener School of Center for Arts, Migration, and Entrepreneurship Center for the Humanities and the Public Sphere Chemical Engineering Chemistry Civil and Coastal Engineering Classics College of Dentistry College of Medicine College of Nursing College of Pharmacy College of Veterinary Medicine Communication Sciences and Disorders Computer & Information Science & Engineering Construction Management | M.E. Rinker, Sr. School of Digital Worlds Institute Division of Military Science Economics Electrical and Computer Engineering English Entomology and Nematology Environmental Engineering Sciences Environmental Horticulture European Studies | Center for Family, Youth and Community Sciences Finance, Insurance and Real Estate Food and Resource Economics Food Science and Human Nutrition Forest, Fisheries, and Geomatics Sciences | School of Gender, Sexuality, and Women’s Studies Geography Geological Sciences Hamilton Center Health Education and Behavior Health Science History Horticultural Sciences Industrial and Systems Engineering Information Systems and Operations Management Innovation Academy Interior Design Jewish Studies | Bud Shorstein Center for Journalism Landscape Architecture Languages, Literatures, and Cultures Latin American Studies | Center for Law | Frederic G. Levin College of Linguistics Management Marketing Materials Science and Engineering Mathematics Mechanical & Aerospace Engineering Media Production, Management, and Technology Microbiology & Cell Science Music | School of Natural Resources and Environment | School of Philosophy Physics Political Science Psychology Public Health Public Relations Religion Sociology and Criminology & Law Soil, Water, and Ecosystem Sciences Spanish and Portuguese Studies Special Education, School Psychology, and Early Childhood Studies | School of Speech, Language, and Hearing Sciences Sport Management Statistics Sustainability and the Built Environment Sustainability Studies Teaching and Learning | School of Theatre + Dance | School of Tourism, Hospitality and Event Management Urban and Regional Planning Whitney Laboratory for Marine Bioscience Wildlife Ecology and Conservation Our Locations Tap in to a wide-ranging network of campuses and satellite offices, each contributing to our mission of excellence in education, research and innovation across the state of Florida. Gainesville, FL Experience the heart of Gator Nation at our Gainesville campus, where state-of-the-art facilities, world-renowned faculty, and a rich academic community converge to foster excellence in education and research. Explore our bustling campus community, cutting-edge laboratories, and sprawling green spaces that inspire innovation and discovery. Outside of campus, enjoy the unique charm of Gainesville, with its lively arts and entertainment scene, diverse culinary offerings, and abundant outdoor recreational opportunities, making it a welcoming and dynamic place to live and learn. Jacksonville, FL Explore groundbreaking health care initiatives at UF Health Jacksonville, where innovation meets compassionate patient care in Florida’s largest city. Situated in the heart of a bustling metropolitan area, our campus offers unparalleled opportunities for medical professionals to thrive in a collaborative and dynamic environment. Experience the vibrant culture and coastal charm of Jacksonville, with its scenic waterfronts and thriving cultural scene. Jupiter, FL Be at the forefront of biomedical research and innovation at The Herbert Wertheim UF Scripps Institute for Biomedical Innovation & Technology in Jupiter, FL. Nestled along Florida’s picturesque Atlantic coast, our campus serves as a hub for groundbreaking research and collaboration, bringing together top scientists and scholars to tackle some of the most pressing health challenges of our time. With state-of-the-art facilities and access to cutting-edge technology, our researchers have the resources they need to drive discovery and make a lasting impact on global health. Enjoy the coastal lifestyle, pristine beaches and year-round sunshine of Jupiter. Satellite Offices From coastal laboratories to IFAS extension offices statewide, our satellite locations foster pioneering research and outreach, bringing UF’s expertise to communities across the globe. Whether it’s agricultural research, marine bioscience, environmental conservation, or community development, our satellite offices play a crucial role in addressing the unique needs and challenges of diverse regions throughout Florida and beyond. Take the next step toward your career goals. Explore a wide variety of unique opportunities at the University of Florida. Explore Jobs Page Contents Popular Topics How to Apply Frequently Asked Questions Veterans’ Preference Benefits Plans Career Paths Perks & Support Career Types Time-Away Working at UF The University of Florida ﻿﻿Professional Development Career Growth About UF About the University of Florida Our Research & Impact Learn about UF’s benefits Worklife Resources Connect Talent Acquisition & Onboarding 8am-5pm (352) 392-2477 talent@hr.ufl.edu 903 West University Avenue Gainesville, FL 32601 Facebook Instagram Twitter YouTube LinkedIn Privacy Statement Google Analytics Privacy Policy Translate Text-Only Site Map Web Update Requests Copyright © 2026, University of Florida"
    },
    "https://jobs.ufl.edu/community/working-at-uf/": {
      "title": "Working",
      "description": "Working at UF - Careers Skip to content Main Navigation Careers Benefits Benefits Plans Time-Away Perks & Support Community The University of Florida Working at UF Career Growth ﻿﻿Professional Development Career Paths Career Types Resources How to Apply Frequently Asked Questions Veterans’ Preference Explore Jobs How can we help you? Homepage Community Working at UF Working at UF Benefits Benefits Plans Time-Away Perks & Support Community The University of Florida Working at UF Career Growth ﻿﻿Professional Development Career Paths Career Types Resources How to Apply Frequently Asked Questions Veterans’ Preference How to Qualify for Veterans’ Preference Resources for Veterans Explore Jobs Housing Take advantage of the GatorPerks Discount Program for exceptional deals on home goods, real estate, moving services and more. To search for housing or find a sublease, UF’s Off Campus Life offers a variety of resources to explore. Transportation Enjoy convenient and reliable transportation options at UF, including RTS public transit, parking services, cycling groups, e-scooters, and car-sharing programs. With additional services like the Campus Connector, Gator Lift and SNAP, getting around campus and Gainesville has never been easier. Entertainment & Recreation Immerse yourself in the vibrant entertainment and recreation opportunities at the University of Florida. Enjoy exclusive access to UF programs such as UF Performing Arts , the Florida Museum of Natural History , the Harn Museum of Art and a wide range of UF athletic events. Outside of UF’s campus locations, enjoy access to natural springs, state parks, amusement parks and unique attractions. Research, IP & Funding UF Research is committed to facilitating the research and scholarship successes of our faculty and students by creating effective collisions between researchers and funding opportunities, marketing our research capabilities to collaborators and funding agencies, and forging institutional relationships with external stakeholders. Employee Education Program Unlock your potential with the University of Florida’s Employee Education Program (EEP) , offering eligible full-time staff tuition assistance for up to six credit hours per semester. Enhance your skills and advance your career with courses at the nearest Florida institution. Take the next step toward your career goals. Explore a wide variety of unique opportunities at the University of Florida. Explore Jobs Page Contents Popular Topics How to Apply Frequently Asked Questions Veterans’ Preference Benefits Plans Career Paths Perks & Support Career Types Time-Away Working at UF The University of Florida ﻿﻿Professional Development Career Growth About UF About the University of Florida Our Research & Impact Learn about UF’s benefits Worklife Resources Connect Talent Acquisition & Onboarding 8am-5pm (352) 392-2477 talent@hr.ufl.edu 903 West University Avenue Gainesville, FL 32601 Facebook Instagram Twitter YouTube LinkedIn Privacy Statement Google Analytics Privacy Policy Translate Text-Only Site Map Web Update Requests Copyright © 2026, University of Florida"
