    "https://jobs.ufl.edu/career-growth/professional-development/": {
      "title": "﻿﻿Professional Development",
      "description": "﻿﻿Professional Development - Careers Skip to content Main Navigation Careers Benefits Benefits Plans Time-Away Perks & Support Community The University of Florida Working at UF Career Growth ﻿﻿Professional Development Career Paths Career Types Resources How to Apply Frequently Asked Questions Veterans’ Preference Explore Jobs How can we help you? Homepage Career Growth ﻿﻿Professional Development ﻿﻿Professional Development Benefits Benefits Plans Time-Away Perks & Support Community The University of Florida Working at UF Career Growth ﻿﻿Professional Development Career Paths Career Types Resources How to Apply Frequently Asked Questions Veterans’ Preference How to Qualify for Veterans’ Preference Resources for Veterans Explore Jobs Career Development Hub At the University of Florida, the Career Development Hub is dedicated to fostering career exploration, personal growth, and professional success among employees. Offering tailored resources and training, it supports staff in navigating their career paths, enhancing their skills, and achieving their professional goals. Training Programs Explore a wealth of opportunities for your professional development at the University of Florida. Whether you’re seeking to advance your career as an employee or ascend as a leader, Training & Organizational Development offers tailored programs to suit your goals and help you earn valuable credentials. Leadership Opportunities True leaders carve their own paths and continually enhance their growth through questioning and learning from their experiences. Develop your leadership skills and potential with a career at the University of Florida. Employee Education Program Unlock your potential with the University of Florida’s Employee Education Program (EEP) , offering eligible full-time staff tuition assistance for up to six credit hours per semester. Enhance your skills and advance your career with courses at the nearest Florida institution. Employee Awards At UF, we celebrate the exceptional dedication of our faculty and staff through various awards programs . From our prestigious Superior Accomplishment Awards to the distinguished Service Recognition Program, we honor outstanding contributions and commitment to our university’s mission. Take the next step toward your career goals. Explore a wide variety of unique opportunities at the University of Florida. Explore Jobs Page Contents Popular Topics How to Apply Frequently Asked Questions Veterans’ Preference Benefits Plans Career Paths Perks & Support Career Types Time-Away Working at UF The University of Florida ﻿﻿Professional Development Career Growth About UF About the University of Florida Our Research & Impact Learn about UF’s benefits Worklife Resources Connect Talent Acquisition & Onboarding 8am-5pm (352) 392-2477 talent@hr.ufl.edu 903 West University Avenue Gainesville, FL 32601 Facebook Instagram Twitter YouTube LinkedIn Privacy Statement Google Analytics Privacy Policy Translate Text-Only Site Map Web Update Requests Copyright © 2026, University of Florida"
