    "https://jobs.ufl.edu/benefits/": {
      "title": "Benefits",
      "description": "Benefits - Careers Skip to content Main Navigation Careers Benefits Benefits Plans Time-Away Perks & Support Community The University of Florida Working at UF Career Growth ﻿﻿Professional Development Career Paths Career Types Resources How to Apply Frequently Asked Questions Veterans’ Preference Explore Jobs How can we help you? Homepage Benefits Benefits Exclusive perks and benefits that grow with you. Discover a comprehensive benefits package available to eligible employees, designed to support your health, financial security. and overall well-being. Our extensive options include health, dental, vision, and life insurance, generous leave policies, and a variety of unique perks found only at UF. Benefits Plans Time-Away Perks & Support Popular Topics How to Apply Frequently Asked Questions Veterans’ Preference Benefits Plans Career Paths Perks & Support Career Types Time-Away Working at UF The University of Florida ﻿﻿Professional Development Career Growth About UF About the University of Florida Our Research & Impact Learn about UF’s benefits Worklife Resources Connect Talent Acquisition & Onboarding 8am-5pm (352) 392-2477 talent@hr.ufl.edu 903 West University Avenue Gainesville, FL 32601 Facebook Instagram Twitter YouTube LinkedIn Privacy Statement Google Analytics Privacy Policy Translate Text-Only Site Map Web Update Requests Copyright © 2026, University of Florida"
