      "description": "Resources - Careers Skip to content Main Navigation Careers Benefits Benefits Plans Time-Away Perks & Support Community The University of Florida Working at UF Career Growth ﻿﻿Professional Development Career Paths Career Types Resources How to Apply Frequently Asked Questions Veterans’ Preference Explore Jobs How can we help you? Homepage Resources Resources Apply with confidence. The resources below are specifically designed to inform, enrich and empower your application process at the University of Florida. Learn more about the application process, explore a variety of career paths, and receive answers to some of the most commonly-asked questions. Let’s see where we can go, together. Frequently Asked Questions How to Apply Veterans' Preference Popular Topics How to Apply Frequently Asked Questions Veterans’ Preference Benefits Plans Career Paths Perks & Support Career Types Time-Away Working at UF The University of Florida ﻿﻿Professional Development Career Growth About UF About the University of Florida Our Research & Impact Learn about UF’s benefits Worklife Resources Connect Talent Acquisition & Onboarding 8am-5pm (352) 392-2477 talent@hr.ufl.edu 903 West University Avenue Gainesville, FL 32601 Facebook Instagram Twitter YouTube LinkedIn Privacy Statement Google Analytics Privacy Policy Translate Text-Only Site Map Web Update Requests Copyright © 2026, University of Florida"
